  "markscheme": {
    "html": "<section class=\"markscheme-part\" data-label=\"a\"><p><strong>a</strong></p><p>- State the period: <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"2.0\\ \\mathrm{s}\"></span> [1 mark]</p></section><section class=\"markscheme-part\" data-label=\"b\"><p><strong>b</strong></p><p>- Calculate <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"f = \\frac{1}{T} = \\frac{1}{2.0} = 0.50\\ \\mathrm{Hz}\"></span> [1 mark]</p></section><section class=\"markscheme-part\" data-label=\"c\"><p><strong>c</strong></p><p>- Calculate angular frequency <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\omega = \\frac{2\\pi}{T} = \\pi\\ \\mathrm{rad\\,s^{-1}}\"></span> (<span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"3.14\\ \\mathrm{rad\\,s^{-1}}\"></span>) OR identify amplitude <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"A = 0.080\\ \\mathrm{m}\"></span> [1 mark]<br/>- Calculate acceleration <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"a_{\\text{max}} = \\omega^2 A = \\pi^2 \\times 0.080 = 0.79\\ \\mathrm{m\\,s^{-2}}\"></span> [1 mark]</p></section><section class=\"markscheme-part\" data-label=\"d\"><p><strong>d</strong></p><p>- The velocity is at a maximum [1 mark]<br/>- At <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"t = 1.0\\ \\mathrm{s}\"></span>, the displacement is zero (the equilibrium position), where kinetic energy/velocity is greatest OR the gradient of the <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"x\"></span>-<span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"t\"></span> graph is at its steepest point [1 mark]</p></section>"
